@startuml
title UML state chart diagram

state "Unregistered" as Unregistered
Unregistered : entry/user not logged in
Unregistered : do/remain unregistered

state "Registered" as Registered
Registered : entry/user logged in
Registered : do/perform actions

state "ViewingVideos" as ViewingVideos
ViewingVideos : entry/watch video
ViewingVideos : do/view video content
ViewingVideos : exit/save video

state "SavedVideos" as SavedVideos
SavedVideos : entry/view saved videos
SavedVideos : do/manage saved videos
SavedVideos : exit/return to registered state

state "Discussion" as Discussion
Discussion : entry/go to discussion
Discussion : do/participate in discussion
Discussion : exit/return to registered state

[*] --> Unregistered

Unregistered --> Registered : CreateAccount
Registered --> ViewingVideos : WatchVideo
ViewingVideos --> Registered : SaveVideo
Registered --> SavedVideos : SaveVideo
SavedVideos --> Registered : ViewSavedVideos
Registered --> Discussion : EnterDiscussion

@enduml
